{"id":"f0380129bd9e48f3","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-gl-decidable.md","title":"GL Decidable Theorem","display":"thm-gl-decidable — GL Decidable Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-gl-decidable","aliases":["89-thm-gl-decidable"],"display":"thm-gl-decidable — GL Decidable Theorem","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-decidability]]","[[89-thm-fmp-gl]]","[[89-df-gl-algorithm]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-gl-decidable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-gl-decidable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-gl-decidable — GL Decidable Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"128a3cd6545693f6\" href=\"?note=128a3cd6545693f6\" title=\"89-df-gl-decidability\">89-df-gl-decidability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f4b51513503cf1c0\" href=\"?note=f4b51513503cf1c0\" title=\"89-thm-fmp-gl\">89-thm-fmp-gl</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3bbdf6f3419b5805\" href=\"?note=3bbdf6f3419b5805\" title=\"89-df-gl-algorithm\">89-df-gl-algorithm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_{\\mathrm{GL}}:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(d_{\\mathrm{GL}}:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> is the bounded finite-model procedure.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gl\\text{-}decidable}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\,\n\\bigl(d_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A)=1\\Longleftrightarrow A\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gl\\text{-}decidable}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\,\n\\bigl(d_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A)=1\\Longleftrightarrow A\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>GL是可判定的</li>\n<li>可判定性通过有限模型性质证明</li>\n<li>这是 GL 的重要性质</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-decidability","status":"resolved","id":"128a3cd6545693f6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-decidability]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-fmp-gl","status":"resolved","id":"f4b51513503cf1c0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-fmp-gl]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-algorithm","status":"resolved","id":"3bbdf6f3419b5805","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-algorithm]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"d_{\\mathrm{GL}}:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gl\\text{-}decidable}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\,\n\\bigl(d_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A)=1\\Longleftrightarrow A\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":779,"backlinks":[{"id":"c1e4657a556ae258","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接依赖给出同一特征函数等价式的 [[89-thm-gl-decidable]]，而不是\n只断言抽象可判定性谓词的同名定理。"},{"id":"1b619488086561ea","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-thm-gl-decidable]] 给出总的特征函数 $d_{\\mathrm{GL}}$；据\n[[89-df-gl-decidability]]，这正是本结论所需的可判定性见证。"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-142","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-thm-arithmetical-completeness-full.md]]\n[[89-thm-arithmetical-completeness.md]]\n[[89-thm-canonical-model-gl.md]]\n[[89-thm-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[89-thm-fixed-point-theorem.md]]\n[[89-thm-fmp-gl.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-completeness-arithmetical.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-completeness-kripke.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-completeness.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-decidability.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-decidable.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-soundness.md]]\n[[89-thm-godel-translation.md]]\n[[89-thm-henkin-provable.md]]\n[[89-thm-lob-theorem.md]]\n[[89-thm-normalization.md]]\n[[89-thm-solovay-theorem.md]]\n[[89-thm-solovay.md]]\n[[89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl.md]]"}],"outgoing":["128a3cd6545693f6","f4b51513503cf1c0","3bbdf6f3419b5805","0006800fa1c85177"]}